  "prefLabel": "Lot 7102.16 Manufacturer",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Lot 7102.16 “Manufacturer” means any person who prints, manufactures, builds, rebuilds, fabricates, assembles, produces, programs, designs, or otherwise makes modifications to any lucky 7 tickets, lucky 7 ticket dispensing devices or associated equipment for use or play in the state of New Hampshire whether directly or pursuant to a contract or agreement with another individual or entity.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1 and #2 at chapter heading for Lot 7100) #13068, eff 6-27-20; ss by #13913, eff 3-22-24 (formerly Lot 7102.13)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/lot7100.html"
